{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
RUG SAMPLE FORM (Corvo addition)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

A button that puts a sample of a rug in the cart.

Every sample is the same hidden product (the "Rug sample"), so the line has to say which rug it is a sample of: it
carries the design's name, its colour references and, in "_design", the handle that lets the cart show the design's
name and photo (see snippets/line-item.liquid). The theme's own <product-form> adds it to the cart.

********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************

* product: the rug the sample is of (required)
* sample: the hidden sample product (required)
* form_id: a unique ID for the form (required)
* label: the content of the button (required)
* style: "outline" (default) or "solid"
* size: "sm" for a smaller button
* live: true on the page of the rug. The rug's steps then write what is being chosen (material, pile height, colours)
  into the sample, so the sample is of that choice (see "syncSample" in assets/rug-configurator.js).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign sample_variant = sample.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign sample_colours = product.metafields.rug.colour_refs.value | join: ', '
  assign design_label = 'rug_page.design' | t
  assign colours_label = 'rug_page.colours' | t
  assign button_style = style | default: 'outline'
-%}

<product-form class="rug-sample">
  <form method="post" action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}" id="{{ form_id }}" accept-charset="UTF-8"{% if live %} data-rug-sample-live{% endif %}>
    <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ sample_variant.id }}">
    <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
    <input type="hidden" name="properties[{{ design_label | escape }}]" value="{{ product.title | escape }}">

    {%- if sample_colours != blank -%}
      <input type="hidden" name="properties[{{ colours_label | escape }}]" value="{{ sample_colours | escape }}" data-rug-sample-colours>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if live -%}
      <div hidden data-rug-sample-choices></div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <input type="hidden" name="properties[_design]" value="{{ product.handle }}">

    <buy-buttons class="buy-buttons" form="{{ form_id }}">
      {%- render 'button', content: label, type: 'submit', style: button_style, size: size, stretch: true -%}
    </buy-buttons>
  </form>
</product-form>
